<title>CYPRUS: Cyprus accepts Lorico maize tender.</title>
<headline>Cyprus accepts Lorico maize tender.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cyprus on Tuesday accepted Lorico France's tender for 18,000 tonnes of maize at $137 per tonne, a statement from the grain commission said.</p>
<p>Prices include C and F.</p>
<p>Shipment is scheduled to take place in January 1997.</p>
</text>
